# COM: Real target lines belonging to an assert(), report_fatal_error(),
# COM: LLVM_DEBUG(), llvm_unreachable() or static_assert() call -- both
# COM: multi-line and (for llvm_unreachable) single-line -- plus a multi-line
# COM: if, else-if, while and for header.
# COM: Every line here is part of one of those calls or control-flow headers,
# COM: so all of them are pruned and only the CSV header row survives.

